# syntax=docker/dockerfile:1
# marp toolchain image (ISI-5768, skill-catalog expansion ISI-5754 §3.2 Design).
# Marp CLI (marp-team/marp-cli) converts Markdown presentations to HTML/PDF/PPTX.
# Installed via npm on node:22-alpine (same base/discipline as Dockerfile.toolchain-node).
# Multi-arch (linux/amd64 + linux/arm64) rides node:22-alpine's multi-arch manifest.
ARG NODE_IMAGE=node:22-alpine
FROM ${NODE_IMAGE}
ARG MARP_VERSION=4.1.1
LABEL org.opencontainers.image.source="https://github.com/K8squad/K8squad" \
      org.opencontainers.image.title="k8squad toolchain: marp"
# Chromium headless is required for PDF/PPTX export (marp --pdf / --pptx).
# puppeteer env vars tell marp-cli to use the system-installed chromium rather than
# downloading its own bundle — avoids the puppeteer 100MB+ download in the image.
RUN apk add --no-cache chromium \
 && npm install -g --no-fund --no-audit "@marp-team/marp-cli@${MARP_VERSION}" \
 && npm cache clean --force
ENV PUPPETEER_SKIP_CHROMIUM_DOWNLOAD=true \
    PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/usr/bin/chromium-browser
ENTRYPOINT ["/usr/local/bin/marp"]
